abstract: >
  Datoviz is a GPU-powered visualization engine for large scientific datasets. The current
  v0.4 development branch provides Python and C APIs for interactive native visualization,
  offscreen rendering, visual examples, and an experimental WebGPU/WASM browser subset.
keywords:
  - scientific visualization
  - GPU rendering
  - Vulkan
  - WebGPU
